{"strongs": "H1438", "word": "גָּדַע", "translit": "ga.da", "root": "גדה", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "hew, hew down or off", "definition": "גָּדַע verb hew, hew down or off (Late Hebrew id. (rare), Aramaic גְּדַע Ithpe`el; Arabic cut off hand or other member, mutilate ) — Qal Perfect גָּדַע Lam 2:3 וְגָדַעְתִּ֫י 1Sam 2:31 Imperfect וָאָגְדַּע Zech 11:10 ; Zech 11:14 Participle passive גְּדוּעָה Isa 15:2 (so many editions but) Baer גְּרוּעָה ; compare below, גְּדֻעִים Isa 10:33 — hew, cut in two , a staff Zech 11:10 ; Zech 11:14 metaphor hew off , an arm 1Sam 2:31 horns Lam 2:3 hew down , trees Isa 10:33 if in Isa 15:2 then = shave off (object זקן , beard), but no other indication of this meaning, and true ᵑ0 גְּרוּעָה , compare Baer's note & Jer 48:37 see גרע . Niph`al Perfect נִגְדַּע Judg 21:6 נֶגְדַּע Jer 50:23 3 feminine singular נִגְדְּעָה Jer 48:25 וְנִגְדְּעָה consecutive Isa 22:25 2 masculine singular נִגְדַּעְתָּ Isa 14:12 3 plural וְנִגְדְּעוּ consecutive Ezek 6:6 ; Amos 3:14 — be hewn off , of altar-horns Amos 3:14 , of idols Ezek 6:6 (|| נשׁבר ); of severance of a tribe from nation Judg 21:6 figurative of king of Babylon Isa 14:12 of Babylon as hammer Jer 50:23 (|| נשׁבר ); of a minister, under figure of secure peg or pin Isa 22:25 of horn of Moab Jer 48:25 (|| נשׁבר ). Pi`el Perfect גִּדַּע 2Chr 34:7 , גִּדֵּ֑עַ 2Chr 34:4 ; Ps 107:16 , וַיְגַדַּע 2Chr 14:2 , אֲגַדֵּ֑עַ Ps 7:5 ; Isa 45:2 , וַיְגַדְּעוּ 2Chr 31:1 3 masculine plural תְּגַדֵּע֑וּן Deut 7:5 ; Deut 12:3 — hew off, down, in two (compare Qal) of Asherîm Deut 7:5 ; 2Chr 14:2 ; 2Chr 31:1 , of idols Deut 12:3 ( פְּסִילִים ) 2Chr 34:4 ; 2Chr 34:7 ( חַמָּנִים ); figurative horns of wicked Ps 75:11 bars of iron (i.e. of Babylon's gates) Isa 45:2 , compare Ps 107:16 . Pu`al Perfect גֻּדָּ֑עוּ Isa 9:9 hew down (of trees).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1512')\">BDB1512</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1438')\">H1438</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1511')\">BDB1511</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1513')\">BDB1513</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>גָּדַע</bdbheb> <b>verb </b> <highlightword>hew, hew down or off</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight> (rare), Aramaic <bdbarc>גְּדַע</bdbarc> Ithpe`el; Arabic <placeholder816/> <highlight>cut off</highlight> hand or other member, <highlight>mutilate</highlight>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>גָּדַע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lam 2:3\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(25,2,3)\">Lam 2:3</ref> <bdbheb>וְגָדַעְתִּ֫י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:31\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,31)\">1Sam 2:31</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>וָאָגְדַּע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zech 11:10\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(38,11,10)\">Zech 11:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 11:14\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(38,11,14)\">Zech 11:14</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> passive <bdbheb>גְּדוּעָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 15:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,15,2)\">Isa 15:2</ref> (so many editions but) <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Baer')\">Baer</lookup> <bdbheb>גְּרוּעָה</bdbheb>; compare below, <bdbheb>גְּדֻעִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 10:33\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,33)\">Isa 10:33</ref> — <highlight>hew, cut in two</highlight>, a staff <ref ref=\"Zech 11:10\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(38,11,10)\">Zech 11:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 11:14\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(38,11,14)\">Zech 11:14</ref> metaphor <highlight>hew off</highlight>, an arm <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:31\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,31)\