4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(30,3,14)\">Amos 3:14</ref> — <highlight>be hewn off</highlight>, of altar-horns <ref ref=\"Amos 3:14\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(30,3,14)\">Amos 3:14</ref>, of idols <ref ref=\"Ezek 6:6\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(26,6,6)\">Ezek 6:6</ref> (|| <bdbheb>נשׁבר</bdbheb>); of severance of a tribe from nation <ref ref=\"Judg 21:6\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(7,21,6)\">Judg 21:6</ref> figurative of king of Babylon <ref ref=\"Isa 14:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,14,12)\">Isa 14:12</ref> of Babylon as hammer <ref ref=\"Jer 50:23\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(24,50,23)\">Jer 50:23</ref> (|| <bdbheb>נשׁבר</bdbheb>); of a minister, under figure of secure peg or pin <ref ref=\"Isa 22:25\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(23,22,25)\">Isa 22:25</ref> of horn of Moab <ref ref=\"Jer 48:25\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(24,48,25)\">Jer 48:25</ref> (|| <bdbheb>נשׁבר</bdbheb>). <b>Pi`el</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>גִּדַּע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 34:7\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(14,34,7)\">2Chr 34:7</ref>, <bdbheb>גִּדֵּ֑עַ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 34:4\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(14,34,4)\">2Chr 34:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 107:16\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"107\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"107\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(19,107,16)\">Ps 107:16</ref>, <bdbheb>וַיְגַדַּע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 14:2\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(14,14,2)\">2Chr 14:2</ref>, <bdbheb>אֲגַדֵּ֑עַ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 7:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,7,5)\">Ps 7:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 45:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,2)\">Isa 45:2</ref>, <bdbheb>וַיְגַדְּעוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 31:1\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(14,31,1)\">2Chr 31:1</ref> 3 masculine plural <bdbheb>תְּגַדֵּע֑וּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 7:5\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(5,7,5)\">Deut 7:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 12:3\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(5,12,3)\">Deut 12:3</ref> — <highlight>hew off, down, in two</highlight> (compare Qal) of <highlight>Asherîm</highlight> <ref ref=\"Deut 7:5\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(5,7,5)\">Deut 7:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 14:2\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(14,14,2)\">2Chr 14:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 31:1\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(14,31,1)\">2Chr 31:1</ref>, of idols <ref ref=\"Deut 12:3\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(5,12,3)\">Deut 12:3</ref> (<bdbheb>פְּסִילִים</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"2Chr 34:4\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(14,34,4)\">2Chr 34:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 34:7\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(14,34,7)\">2Chr 34:7</ref> (<bdbheb>חַמָּנִים</bdbheb>); figurative horns of wicked <ref ref=\"Ps 75:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"75\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"75\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,75,11)\">Ps 75:11</ref> bars of iron (i.e. of Babylon's gates) <ref ref=\"Isa 45:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,2)\">Isa 45:2</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Ps 107:16\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"107\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"107\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(19,107,16)\">Ps 107:16</ref>. <b>Pu`al</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>גֻּדָּ֑עוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Is